{09 01 00}{09 08 00}Hei, {ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00},{01 00 00 0a 00} ma ei
tea, kuidas seda sulle
öelda, aga{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0a 00}
{07 14 00}Osa täiskasvanuks olemisest{01 00 00 0a 00}
on oskus süüa teha.

{07 19 00}Sa peaksid vähemalt oskama
kokku klopsida lihtsa
{04 13 00}!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 14 00}Tee hee! {01 00 00 0f 00}Actually, I'm really
good at eating, too,
{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 13 00}I like to stuff my face
with as many marshmallows{01 00 00 05 00}
as I can.
Then, {01 00 00 05 00}I try to say "snuggle
bunnies!" {07 03 00}You should try it!{01 00 00 05 00}
It's the funnest thing ever!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 14 00}Hihii! {01 00 00 0f 00}Tegelikult olen ma
ka söömises väga hea,
{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.
{07 13 00}Mulle meeldib toppida suu
täis nii palju vahukomme{01 00 00 05 00}
kui suudan.
Siis {01 00 00 05 00}üritan öelda „kaisu-
jänkud!” {07 03 00}Proovi sinagi!{01 00 00 05 00}
See on kõige lõbusam asi!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}You know what?!{01 00 00 05 00} {07 01 00}I think
you're just trying not to
stir things up!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 00 00}Tead mida?!{01 00 00 05 00} {07 01 00}Ma arvan, et
sa lihtsalt üritad mitte
tüli üles kiskuda!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 01 00}Your wishy-washiness will 
have the opposite effect
of what you intended!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 01 00}Sinu kõhklemine annab
vastupidise tulemuse
sellele, mida kavatsesid!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 11 00}She thinks she's the
fashion queen or something!

{07 01 00}Who is she to give us
advice on clothes? {01 00 00 05 00}I mean,{01 00 00 05 00}
seriously! {01 00 00 05 00}Just look at her!{09 09 00}

{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 0e 00}Though, {01 00 00 05 00}you know,{01 00 00 05 00} it might
be nice to have a car,{01 01 00} even
if it were a junker.{07 00 00}
{07 08 00}My feet get SO tired and
achy from walking
everywhere.{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 0e 00}Kuigi, {01 00 00 05 00}tead,{01 00 00 05 00} oleks
tore, kui oleks auto,{01 01 00} isegi
kui see oleks romu.{07 00 00}
{07 08 00}Mu jalad väsivad NII ära ja
valutavad kõikjale
kõndimisest.{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 01 00}Know why our feet hurt?{01 01 00}{07 09 00}
'Cause we can't buy shoes
in this backwater town.{01 00 00 14 00}{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 01 00}Tead, miks meie jalad valutavad?{01 01 00}{07 09 00}
Sest selles kolkalinnas
ei saa kingi osta.{01 00 00 14 00}{09 09 00}
